  "notes": "This is a sophisticated insurance emergency response dashboard with a clean, medical/professional aesthetic using a blue primary color scheme. The layout uses a persistent left sidebar for navigation, a top header bar, and a main content area organized into multiple card-based sections. Key interactive elements include the emergency type selector (with one option pre-selected), document upload checklist, real-time claim tracking progress indicator, and an AI-powered approval probability meter showing 92%. The design emphasizes urgency and clarity with clear visual hierarchy, status indicators (verified/upload/pending), and prominent emergency contact options including a direct priority phone line."
